[16:24:02] [ModMenu/Update Checker/2/DEBUG] (Mod Menu/Update Checker) {"42fe06a46a9e893b8a12324255368517132b262c8fce5d7eab1d60a5ec7f9f6d57aadf90d1a2ede7d9bbab606bdcf98e8676cc90ec818b601bbfcd9b96296cb3":{"game_versions":["26.3"],"loaders":["fabric","quilt"],"environment":"client_or_server_prefers_both","id":"71CTWqdE","project_id":"nvQzSEkH","author_id":"UxbEV316","featured":false,"name":"[Fabric 26.3.X] 26.3.5","version_number":"26.3.5+fabric","changelog":"## 26.3.5\r\n\r\n- Merge branch '26.3-fabric' of https://github.com/Snownee/Jade into 26.3-fabric\r\n- fix: publish config value before onUpdate to prevent re-entrant StackOverflowError ([#821](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/821))\r\n- refactor: route DataComponentMap.Builder component check through CommonProxy\r\n\r\n## 26.3.4\r\n\r\n- improve: ConfigIcon.Item now holds ItemStackTemplate\r\n- chore: fix typo and bump mixin compatibility level to Java 25\r\n- fix: validate entity targets on the server\r\n- fix: only request server data providers acknowledged by the server\r\n- fix: write config files atomically and fix CachedSupplier publication\r\n- fix: always clean up fetching state in PlayerNameLookup\r\n- fix: rate limit server data requests to prevent packet spam\r\n- improve: do not ignore invisible entity if it has equipment (close [#83](https://github.com/Snownee/JadeAddons/issues/83))\r\n\r\n## 26.3.3\r\n\r\n- fix: trial spawner cooldown shown under unexpected situation (close [#815](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/815))\r\n- feat: villager restock cooldown\r\n- refactor: rebuild config search results only when they change\r\n- refactor: play popup toggle sound in SecondaryPopup\r\n\r\n## 26.3.2\r\n\r\n- feat: config UI card mode\r\n- refactor: decouple options UI from config model for reuse\r\n- build: minify JSON resources when packaging the jar\r\n\r\n## 26.3.1\r\n\r\n- fix: check collider shape when ray tracing entities\r\n- feat: add recipe lookup keybind tooltips\r\n- rc1\r\n- fix: improve compatibility with Create Aeronautics\r\n- fix: item serialization incompatibility with polymer (close [#792](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/792))\r\n- fix: Width of TextElementImpl is miscalculated when Caxton is present\r\n- feat: box progress provider API ([#811](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/811))\r\n- fix: check block entity type in vanilla providers (close [#765](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/765))\r\n- feat: drag to scroll list\r\n- fix: entity ray tracing (close [#749](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/749))\r\n- refactor: abstract SmoothScrollableList\r\n- fix: OptionsNav entries not clickable after MC 26.3 mouse button renumbering\r\n- feat: use fabric enchantment power provider api\r\n- pre3\r\n- feat:tool tier removal api\r\n- s10\r\n- feat: add REI placeholders\r\n- fix: [#804](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/804)\r\n- fix: Seagrass harvestability (close [#805](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/805))\r\n- compat: add support for RRV ([#786](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/786))\r\n- Merge branch '26.3-fabric' of https://github.com/Snownee/Jade into 26.3-fabric\r\n- Validate block requests before accessing the level ([#801](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/801))\r\n- s7\r\n- fix: text width calculation (close [#791](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/791))\r\n- improve: use rounded entity health (close [#788](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/788))\r\n- fix: [#796](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/796)\r\n- Merge branch '26.3-fabric' of https://github.com/Snownee/Jade into 26.3-fabric\r\n- feat: add `/jadec generate_server_overrides`\r\n- Update build.gradle for 26.3-fabric\r\n- improve: vanilla harvest addon\r\n- port\r\n- improve: bypass singleplayer reach distance check\r\n\r\n## 26.2.9\r\n\r\n- chore: API javadocs\r\n- Add harvest tool registration API ([#772](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/772))\r\n","changelog_url":null,"date_published":"2026-10-02T23:48:24.505954Z","downloads":416936,"version_type":"release","status":"listed","requested_status":null,"files":[{"id":"kxtFx3Ft","hashes":{"sha512":"2e7331e62eb6658268ae92dc42de8b469f50dd6c6a9d2546a6f649bae97c2cdfd8d4c1560948cf46269175d2c79c6c47a36a02685e39d476768d18fbb2a28703","sha1":"da61413c586c8918c14e2bbfdc808ce2d56ea9df"},"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nvQzSEkH/versions/71CTWqdE/Jade-mc26.3-Fabric-26.3.5.jar","filename":"Jade-mc26.3-Fabric-26.3.5.jar","primary":true,"size":1092685,"file_type":null},{"id":"bDO4LMkn","hashes":{"sha512":"288a811312e66d9eb9bf608f0c025a74c57ed4959bfe426efb7828c760e12d4bdd520fae790c2a016c79f06c8b9bac112bb83ad981d42d293d28a7eb75901028","sha1":"5c1321e9d6f9d1ba0e62666394013fcc44b88dd7"},"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nvQzSEkH/versions/71CTWqdE/Jade-mc26.3-Fabric-26.3.5-sources.jar","filename":"Jade-mc26.3-Fabric-26.3.5-sources.jar","primary":false,"size":547160,"file_type":null}],"dependencies":[{"version_id":null,"project_id":"u6dRKJwZ","file_name":null,"dependency_type":"optional"},{"version_id":null,"project_id":"P7dR8mSH","file_name":null,"dependency_type":"required"}]},"884a1ef0ce0e69d565d41a1359070a8d4f8589a086b565540defdb4741985053077dfd0f2a56898ce60510720a9f95dd8ba220a9a6340b6e0cf5cb12352e2419":{"game_versions":["26.3"],"loaders":["fabric"],"environment":"client_only","id":"bAZQdGpg","project_id":"AANobbMI","author_id":"TEZXhE2U","featured":false,"name":"Sodium 0.9.2 for Fabric 26.3","version_number":"mc26.3-0.9.2-fabric","changelog":"Sodium 0.9.2 is a release for Minecraft 26.3. It's based on the recently released Sodium 0.9.2.\n\n- Port to 26.3 ([#3902](https://github.com/CaffeineMC/sodium/pull/3902))\n- Re-enable \"Fullscreen Resolution\" control on Linux ([#3843](https://github.com/CaffeineMC/sodium/pull/3843))\n- Fix a memory leak caused by recreating resources in the F3 display\n- Fix issues with falling blocks","changelog_url":null,"date_published":"2026-09-15T15:57:23.369305Z","downloads":4300271,"version_type":"release"